## 4. User Experience & Design

### 4.1. The "Gemini" Command Bar

- **Location:** Bottom of the screen.
- **Function:** A global search bar (Cmd+P style) to quickly jump between projects or find a port.
- **Style:** Minimalist, translucent background with high-fidelity typography.

### 4.2. Workspace View

| **Column** | **Content** | **Action** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Navigator** | List of all Repos + Git branch status. | `[Space]` to Expand. |
| **Services** | List of active ports/processes. | `[K]` to Kill. |
| **Console** | Live output of the selected project. | `[T]` to Open Full Terminal. |

