## 5. Technical Implementation (Orchestrator Logic)

### 5.1. Execution Wrapper

Instead of `os.system`, the TUI uses a Managed Process class to track life-cycles.

Python

`# The Orchestrator Logic
def spawn_process(project_path, script):
    venv_path = find_venv(project_path)
    env_vars = load_dotenv(project_path)
    
    # Run directly using the venv's interpreter
    return subprocess.Popen(
        [f"{venv_path}/bin/python", script],
        cwd=project_path,
        env={**os.environ, **env_vars},
        stdout=subprocess.PIPE,
        stderr=subprocess.STDOUT
    )`

